@startuml
[*] --> ResourceAllocationRequest
ResourceAllocationRequest --> ResourceAvailabilityCheck
ResourceAvailabilityCheck --> ResourceAllocation : Resources Available?
ResourceAvailabilityCheck --> ResourceReallocation : Resources Unavailable
ResourceAllocation --> TaskExecution
ResourceReallocation --> TaskExecution
TaskExecution --> ResourceAdjustment : Task Requirements Change
TaskExecution --> [*] : Task Completion
ResourceAdjustment --> TaskExecution
@enduml
